<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45334" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔτρεπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easily changing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				400a23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					4.532
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.912b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic., of
			diseases, <i>mild</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.590
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ. ἐς συγκοπήν</span>
			<i>easily turning</i> to . . , <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> of the skin,
				<i>sensitive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Menemach.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.15.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>ready, inclined</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εὔ. πρὸς μεταβολάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.978f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>versatile</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.121
			</span></i>, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				4.86
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τως</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐτρεπῶς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				61
			</span></i>.</div>
